Agent: The product category that earns the most revenue is **electronics** with a total revenue of **312,150.0**.

```sql
WITH product_category_revenue AS (
    SELECT 
        p.category,
        SUM(oi.quantity * p.price) as revenue
    FROM order_items oi
    JOIN products p ON oi.product_id = p.id
    JOIN orders o ON oi.order_id = o.id
    WHERE o.status != 'cancelled'
    GROUP BY p.category
)
SELECT * FROM product_category_revenue ORDER BY revenue DESC LIMIT 1;
```
